Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:23.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.20,0:02:45.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《爬行人》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.19,0:03:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可以去通知皇家学会的秘书\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may inform the Secretary of the Royal Society{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.15,0:03:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我讲座的题目是\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I have entitled my lecture{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.04,0:03:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「达尔文的根本性错误」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darwin's Fundamental Error.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.01,0:03:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这会引发不少抗议的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll raise a few hackles, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.28,0:03:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可不是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will it not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.12,0:03:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must be off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.10,0:03:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些人都要通知到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can acknowledge all of these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.18,0:03:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这家伙不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a good chap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.66,0:03:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.07,0:03:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.96,0:03:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的 什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.26,0:03:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昨晚你听到罗伊的叫声了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear how Roy barked last night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.85,0:03:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was dreadful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.91,0:03:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我没有听见\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.18,0:03:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你听见了么 班尼特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear him Bennett?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.28,0:03:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也没有 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't say I did, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.99,0:03:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它不停地叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}He kept on and on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.74,0:03:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还在咆哮\N{\fnArial\fs30}He howled too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.34,0:03:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肯定是有人进了花园\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure someone got into the garden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.83,0:03:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人闯入？\N{\fnArial\fs30}An intruder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.54,0:03:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well yes, because.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.18,0:03:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.55,0:03:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人从窗户外\N{\fnArial\fs30}someone looked in at me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.52,0:03:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}at my window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.46,0:03:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.63,0:03:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是在做梦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have been dreaming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.98,0:04:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊迪丝 没人能爬到你的窗口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Edith nobody could reach your window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.76,0:04:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}窗户离地面太远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's far too far off the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.13,0:04:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我肯定不是在做梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure I wasn't dreaming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.94,0:04:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}班尼特 你来负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bennett, you take charge{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.67,0:04:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不然我就赶不上参加教工会议了\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I shall be late for the faculty meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.77,0:04:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我让你的未婚夫来照顾你 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I leave you in your fiance's care my dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.25,0:04:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果他做你的丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he proves as good a husband to you as{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.07,0:04:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也能像做我的助理那么出色\N{\fnArial\fs30}he has amanuenses to me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.38,0:04:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就是个幸运的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll be a fortunate woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.46,0:04:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}缓和一下她的恐惧情绪 班尼特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allay her fears Bennett.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.88,0:04:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你相信我么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you believe me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.90,0:04:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没法轻易相信啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not easily, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.13,0:04:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像你父亲说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean as your father said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.63,0:04:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你就来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.97,0:04:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我实在是太忙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm awfully busy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.13,0:04:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些关于松鼠猴的笔记要打印\N{\fnArial\fs30}with these notes on Saimiri Sciureus to type, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.46,0:04:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后是你父亲关于论证…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then the proof of your father's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.63,0:04:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰克 我不是在做梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, I know I wasn't dreaming{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.02,0:04:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道罗伊不会无缘无故乱叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you know Roy doesn't bark at nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.29,0:04:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望你亲自去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to see for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.02,0:04:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你必须来看看 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.98,0:04:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在狗叫声吵醒我之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then after the barking woke me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.97,0:04:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听到了别的声音 从那下面传来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard another sound from just below here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.05,0:04:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从那下面？\N{\fnArial\fs30}From below?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.66,0:04:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这 还有那 看到了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}There and there, do you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.83,0:04:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}常春藤被拉开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ivy's pulled away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.37,0:05:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我肯定是吓晕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must have fainted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.97,0:05:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}醒来时天已经亮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next thing I knew it was dawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.51,0:05:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能肯定你不是在做梦 伊迪丝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're quite, quite certain you didn't dream this, Edith?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.96,0:05:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.63,0:05:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰克 我要你全心全意地相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, I insist you believe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.37,0:05:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.49,0:05:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要你去把这些事告诉福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that you inform Sherlock Holmes of the facts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.79,0:05:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.41,0:05:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不然我就要重新考虑我们的婚事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I shall reconsider our engagement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.59,0:05:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.10,0:05:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能和一个不相信我的人 携手共度此生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could not give my hand to a man who doubts my word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.20,0:06:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 如方便请前来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson, come at once if convenient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.57,0:06:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不方便亦来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If inconvenient come all the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.11,0:06:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 我收到了你的便条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes, I got your note{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.48,0:06:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是不方便\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it is inconvenient, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.71,0:06:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确实不方便\N{\fnArial\fs30}damned inconvenient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.96,0:06:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的旧伤又在困扰你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your old wound is troubling you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.46,0:06:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.42,0:07:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看未必\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prefer to differ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.11,0:07:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你上楼时脚步不稳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your step was uneven on the stairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.02,0:07:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我做了一天的手术 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a full surgery Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.79,0:07:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得原谅 我有点走神\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must excuse a certain abstraction of mind, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.83,0:07:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.67,0:07:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这件事很复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a tangled scheme.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.49,0:07:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我正努力找出头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been looking for the loose end which might unravel it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.10,0:07:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以便解决它\N{\fnArial\fs30}One such might reside in the question, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.26,0:07:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}问题的关键在于到底普利斯伯瑞教授的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}does Professor Presbury's daughter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.60,0:07:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是清醒的还是在做梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}wake or dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.32,0:07:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你把我叫来 就为这么个事儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm summoned here for no more than this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.04,0:07:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你肯定听说过普利斯伯瑞？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've heard of Presbury?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.67,0:07:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 谁没听说过呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, who hasn't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.42,0:07:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们最著名的自然科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's our most distinguished natural scientist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.62,0:07:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是个鳏夫 有一个女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a widower with one daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.48,0:07:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他女儿坚持说 夜里有人在她窗边出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}She insists someone appeared at her window last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.88,0:07:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}普利斯伯瑞小姐的卧室在三楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Presbury's bedroom is on the second floor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.97,0:07:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使是最敏捷的飞贼也没法爬上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and is completely inaccessible to even the most agile cat burglar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.93,0:07:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}读一读这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.44,0:07:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是一点钟的邮车送来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It arrived by the 1:00 post.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.25,0:08:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}写信的人已经提前来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The author already arrives ahead of his time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.96,0:08:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是个非常性急的年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}a most precipitant young man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.04,0:08:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}班尼特先生 这是我的朋友和同事华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bennett, my friend and colleague Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.44,0:08:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您好\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.21,0:08:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}班尼特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bennett.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.03,0:08:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.76,0:08:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 请原谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, forgive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.87,0:08:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 恐怕我的判断严重有误\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Holmes, I fear I've made a grave error of judgment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.03,0:08:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我本来是不该来找您的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should not have been in touch with you at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.73,0:08:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是在浪费你的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've wasted your time entirely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.63,0:08:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有什么合理的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not a rational reason{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.78,0:08:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能解释普利斯伯瑞小姐的恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}for Ms. Presbury's fears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.61,0:08:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 是无法解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no I can't say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.14,0:08:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这事很微妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well it's, it's a delicate matter but I, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.17,0:08:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我必须请求您不要再继续了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must beg you to proceed no further.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.27,0:08:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 我会补偿你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can of course recompense you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.77,0:08:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}班尼特先生 你在信里有所隐瞒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bennett, your letter was less than frank, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.58,0:08:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}was it not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.94,0:08:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说出了全部事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}I set out the facts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.31,0:08:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我怀疑不是全部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all I suspect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.57,0:08:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许是出于对未婚妻普利斯伯瑞小姐的忠诚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably out of loyalty to your fiance, Ms. Presbury?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.90,0:08:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您听说过她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're aware of her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.86,0:08:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 我还听说\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I am of your employer's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.01,0:08:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的雇主跟爱丽丝墨菲小姐订了婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}engagement to Ms. Alice Morphy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.97,0:08:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她可是著名解剖学家的女儿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}the daughter of the famous comparative anatomist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.78,0:09:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她与普利斯伯瑞家是邻居 是么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She resides next door to the Presburys, does she not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.46,0:09:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么知道他们订婚了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know of the engagement?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.37,0:09:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}婚讯就登在泰晤士报上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Times, July the 1st, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.13,0:09:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}分别是七月一日和九月五日\N{\fnArial\fs30}September the 5th respectively.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.71,0:09:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生可以说是过目不忘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Holmes' memory is of a photographical order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.30,0:09:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确实是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.22,0:09:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.34,0:09:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}班尼特 我了解你的窘境\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bennett, I do appreciate your predicament.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.62,0:09:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为一个科学家 一个理性主义者\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a scientist and a rationalist yourself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.60,0:09:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不愿意采纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dare say you're reluctant to accept the evidence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.34,0:09:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}普利斯伯瑞小姐所坚持的证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}insisted upon by Ms. Presbury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.21,0:09:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}况且 作为她父亲信任的助手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Further, as a father's trusted assistant{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.72,0:09:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向我求助也陷你于不忠\N{\fnArial\fs30}to have recourse to me must smack to you of disloyalty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.45,0:09:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一点不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.13,0:09:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是这个家庭的一份子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm part of the family except that Edith, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.55,0:09:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除非普利斯伯瑞小姐因为不安而\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Presbury, she was so upset that she, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.12,0:09:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}班尼特先生 你更愿意疏远谁呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bennett, who would you prefer to alienate, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.17,0:09:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你未来的妻子还是她那著名的父亲？\N{\fnArial\fs30}your perspective wife or her celebrated father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.68,0:09:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你让我陷入两难 都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give me a choice of evils, neither.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.57,0:09:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就多告诉我一些事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then furnish me with the facts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.15,0:09:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看我能不能帮助你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will see how I can help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.86,0:09:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可以依赖我们两个的判断力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may rely on the discretion of both of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.91,0:09:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.52,0:10:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比如说 你会不会把普利斯伯瑞小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you for example describe Ms. Presbury, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.46,0:10:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}描述成一个敏感爱幻想的女孩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}as an impressionable, fanciful girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.13,0:10:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 恰恰相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, quite the reverse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.51,0:10:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么爱丽丝墨菲小姐呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Alice Morphy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.39,0:10:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许普利斯伯瑞教授和她订婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps Professor Presbury's engagement to her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.67,0:10:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让你感到意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}came to you as something of a surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.08,0:10:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毕竟他的年龄是她的三倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is after all three times her age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.51,0:10:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}选这件天鹅绒的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this velour?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.30,0:10:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我更中意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prefer that one, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.90,0:10:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带白色羽毛的那一件\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the osprey feathers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.17,0:10:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能去问问他么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you ask him, do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.26,0:10:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我父亲对他的兰花最自豪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father's extremely proud of his orchids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.49,0:10:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我讨厌它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.48,0:10:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们是那么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're so, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.23,0:10:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么说呢 那么的不纯洁\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh I don't know, so impure somehow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.43,0:10:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你去跟他说别再送兰花了 好么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do please ask him not to send them anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.43,0:10:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就你这么一个好朋友了 求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a sweet friend, Edith, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.91,0:10:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你自己不能去说么 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you not ask him? - I couldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.00,0:10:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不敢 我很懦弱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dare not. I'm such a coward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.23,0:10:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 恩 - 求求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well. - Oh, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.81,0:10:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你比我要有个性的多\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got so much more character than me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.42,0:10:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟他一样有很强的个性\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're as strong as he.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.71,0:11:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是爱丽丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Alice, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.51,0:11:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你连这个都不敢对我父亲说\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you dare not ask this of my father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.47,0:11:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那结婚以后 你怎么去处理那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}how will you ever manage those deeper conflicts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.15,0:11:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使是最幸福的婚姻中也会存在的冲突呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}that occur even in the happiest of marriages?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.36,0:11:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.94,0:11:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so frightened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.69,0:11:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}害怕和我父亲结婚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of marrying my father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.67,0:11:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.07,0:11:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请别再问了\N{\fnArial\fs30}no, please don't ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.06,0:11:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们别再谈这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's not speak of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.16,0:11:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得这个怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think of this one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.59,0:11:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不论是普利斯伯瑞小姐还是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither Ms. Presbury nor I{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.44,0:11:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都认为她父亲对墨菲小姐的迷恋\N{\fnArial\fs30}consider her father's infatuation with Ms. Morphy to be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.32,0:11:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总的说来不是很合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}entirely appropriate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.64,0:11:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有点极端\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rather excessive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.21,0:11:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的父母 对这门亲事也没有反对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And her parents have no objections to the marriage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.66,0:11:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教授是个受人尊敬的鳏夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}The professor is a respectable widower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.23,0:11:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且还很富有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a wealthy man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.80,0:11:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我什么时候能去拜访？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When may I call?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.42,0:11:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜访？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.98,0:11:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去查看普利斯伯瑞小姐的窗口\N{\fnArial\fs30}To view Ms. Presbury's window, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.66,0:11:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲自去判断\N{\fnArial\fs30}to determine for myself its accessibility{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.72,0:12:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是否存在有人闯入的可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}and otherwise to an intruder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.92,0:12:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明天早上11点可以么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we say 11:00 tomorrow morning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.69,0:12:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教授那时会在学校里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor Presbury will be at his college.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.49,0:12:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就没有问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's of no matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.17,0:12:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的请求完全合理\N{\fnArial\fs30}At present my inquiries are purely logistical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.64,0:12:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对教授从没有什么隐瞒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have never had any secrets from the professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.98,0:12:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}班尼特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bennett, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.05,0:12:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我提醒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}let me refer you to your first question, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.06,0:12:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你事实上已经回答了我的第一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}which you have in fact answered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.22,0:12:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比起你的雇主\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're more inclined to Ms. Presbury's party{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.08,0:12:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你更倾向于普利斯伯瑞小姐一方\N{\fnArial\fs30}than you are to your employer's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.64,0:12:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我想是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes, I dare say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.40,0:12:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.69,0:12:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.26,0:12:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.16,0:12:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 你这是在刺探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes, you're prying{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.86,0:12:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个受人尊敬的家庭的家务事\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the affairs of a perfectly respectable family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.06,0:12:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么班尼特这么不情愿说出实情？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is Bennett so reluctant to tell the truth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.58,0:12:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loyalty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.40,0:12:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是显而易见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is as plain as a pack staff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.89,0:12:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但愿如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us hope so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.19,0:12:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他却是被迫写信给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet he wrote to me under duress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.63,0:12:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你注意到他的笔迹了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You notice his handwriting, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.65,0:12:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}字母T下笔很重\N{\fnArial\fs30}the crossing of the T's with such deep indentation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.97,0:13:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有他刚来的时候 努力要取消这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then upon his arrival his endeavors to call the whole thing off, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.25,0:13:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 这件事可不是看上去的这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}no, there's more to this than meets the eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.07,0:13:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.87,0:13:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杀鸡焉用宰牛刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}This case is unworthy of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.54,0:13:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得回诊所去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must return to my surgery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.58,0:13:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许明天再见喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'll see you tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.67,0:13:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.38,0:13:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.46,0:14:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你昨晚睡得好点了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you slept better?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.31,0:14:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.20,0:14:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昨晚我搬到客房去睡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night I moved to the guest bedroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.65,0:14:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没这个必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no need surely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.56,0:14:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那只是场噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was but an ugly dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.77,0:14:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲 爱丽丝要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, Alice has asked me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.80,0:14:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.91,0:14:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实际上她根本不喜欢兰花\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth is she does not care for orchids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.93,0:14:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她不喜欢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.36,0:14:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那她为什么不说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, why did she not say so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.57,0:14:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她不敢说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she was afraid to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.51,0:14:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您不知道您是多么令人畏惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You forget how formidable you are father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.51,0:14:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}傻女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The silly girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.67,0:14:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那她会收到玫瑰的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then she shall have roses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.06,0:14:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两打红玫瑰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, two dozen red roses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.54,0:14:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伊昨晚很安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy was quiet enough last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.53,0:14:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别激怒它 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to rouse him, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.94,0:14:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它本来很温顺的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Docility itself…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.95,0:14:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.19,0:15:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它会适应这些锁链的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's grown accustomed to his shackles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.42,0:15:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可怜的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The poor beast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.82,0:15:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们可以上去么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we go up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.07,0:15:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果普利斯伯瑞小姐不反对的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Ms. Presbury has no objection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.23,0:15:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我明白必须这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand the necessity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.17,0:15:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们来带路吧 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us lead the way my dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.24,0:15:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很高兴你今天恢复正常了 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you're more yourself today, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.04,0:15:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你昨天简直像是头熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were a veritable bear yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.61,0:15:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许有点脾气不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}A touch liverish perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.99,0:15:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是这出现了人影？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where the figure appeared?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.59,0:15:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.67,0:15:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有什么梯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no ladder on the premises{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.04,0:15:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能伸到这个高度吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}that could reach this height?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.73,0:15:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.47,0:15:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}窗子是半开着的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was the window ajar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.93,0:15:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我把门锁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I keep the door locked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.27,0:15:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的手碰到窗玻璃了么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did the hand touch the windowpane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.64,0:15:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.03,0:15:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我晕过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fainted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.63,0:15:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你当然会的 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you did, of course you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.96,0:16:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是令人生畏的高度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's a formidable elevation, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.34,0:16:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管常春藤很牢固\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet the ivy's strong, Hedera Helixis, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.52,0:16:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但在那还是给扯断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}torn away just here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.68,0:16:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}普利斯伯瑞小姐 你父亲提前回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Presbury, your father has returned prematurely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.70,0:16:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.47,0:16:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能让他知道你在这里 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}He mustn't know you're here Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.18,0:16:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这没法避免\N{\fnArial\fs30}That can scarcely be avoided.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.06,0:16:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管怎么说 我们先下去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, let us go down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.04,0:16:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从后楼梯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The backstairs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.43,0:16:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.35,0:16:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}班尼特 你是怎么准备我的讲座的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bennett, what did you do with my lecture?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.26,0:16:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你到底是谁 先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the devil are you, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.22,0:16:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.72,0:16:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是歇洛克·福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.50,0:16:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.32,0:16:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}著名侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}The detective.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.38,0:16:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}普利斯伯瑞教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor Presbury, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.22,0:16:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的名片\N{\fnArial\fs30}my card.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.29,0:17:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}221 B\N{\fnArial\fs30}221 B, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.60,0:17:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么个地址很难激起别人的信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}hardly an address to inspire confidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.70,0:17:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从没想过要激起别人的信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have never sought to inspire confidence in others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.06,0:17:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对自己倒是信心十足\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have quite enough of my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.25,0:17:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来介绍我的同事 华生医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I introduce my colleague Dr. Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.97,0:17:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不必了 你们俩都可以马上离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly not, you may leave at once the pair of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.06,0:17:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲 他们是我们请来的客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, they are here at our request.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.65,0:17:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可没有请他们 伊迪丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not mine, Edith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.70,0:17:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至于你 班尼特\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you Bennett, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.37,0:17:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在你寻求用这种解决方式前应该和我商量\N{\fnArial\fs30}you should have consulted me before resorting to such methods, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.58,0:17:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个平庸的侦探和他的同伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}a common detective and his accomplice, really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.92,0:17:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, sir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.23,0:17:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来护送你们从这里出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}allow me to escort you from the premises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.17,0:17:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的助手没有权力雇佣你处理这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}My assistant had no authority to engage you in this matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.96,0:17:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别再调查它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kindly inquire into it no further.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.65,0:17:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不然的话我会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should you persist I shall have no hesitation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.98,0:17:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毫不犹豫的叫警察的\N{\fnArial\fs30}in calling the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.53,0:17:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和苏格兰场的雷斯垂德可很熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lestrade of Yard is well known{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.70,0:17:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以你最好小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}to me so beware.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.49,0:17:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去找雷斯垂德嘛 我可是会犹疑的 教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would hesitate in calling Lestrade, professor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.93,0:17:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你希望解开这个谜的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you wish to have the mystery solved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.12,0:17:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}压根就没有什么谜 先生 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no mystery, sir, none.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.67,0:17:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在你们可以走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now be gone with you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.83,0:17:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}否则我就要放狗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}or would you have me release my dog?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.29,0:17:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它可分不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me he'll not distinguish{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.94,0:18:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁是雇来的私家侦探 谁是入侵者\N{\fnArial\fs30}between a hired snoop and an intruder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.38,0:18:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们还不走吗 先生们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you be gone, sir, will you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.72,0:18:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们会走的 你也别太过分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall, sir, we shall but you are over the mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.66,0:18:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说话要小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kindly watch your words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.54,0:18:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个品种的狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a breed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.01,0:18:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然外表很凶猛\N{\fnArial\fs30}despite their ferocious appearance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.65,0:18:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实际上举止却并不凶猛\N{\fnArial\fs30}these dogs are seldom vicious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.42,0:18:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很奇怪罗伊为什么要整天拴着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm surprised that Roy needs chaining at all{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.01,0:18:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除非是为了你的安全吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless it is for your safety as much as ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.42,0:19:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 狗能反映一个家庭的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dog reflects family life Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.69,0:19:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.00,0:19:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁听说过在阴郁的家庭里有只欢闹的狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever heard of a frisky dog in a gloomy home{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.99,0:19:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或是在欢乐的家里有只悲伤的狗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}or a sad dog in a happy one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.46,0:19:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}易怒的人养着易怒的狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snarling people have snarling dogs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.98,0:19:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你像我一样注意到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You observed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.45,0:19:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}普利斯伯瑞家的爱尔兰猎狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Presbury's Irish wolfhound as well as I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.62,0:19:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它对它的主人咆哮着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He growled quite as much at his master as it did at us, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.78,0:19:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像对待我们两个陌生人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}two complete strangers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.56,0:19:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这动物毫不掩饰它对教授的敌意\N{\fnArial\fs30}That animal did not reserve its animosity solely for the professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.79,0:19:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等一会班尼特来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll seek verification from{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.05,0:19:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们会从他那确认这一点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}young Bennett when he arrives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.13,0:19:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在「山羊罗盘」酒馆会面后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sent word by way of Jack Macphail{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.96,0:19:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我顺道给杰克 麦克费尔捎了信\N{\fnArial\fs30}after our meeting at the Goat and Compasses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.13,0:19:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的另一个密探么 福尔摩斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another of your agents Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.85,0:19:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是普利斯伯瑞家的马车夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Presburys' coachman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.72,0:19:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他负责看管罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has charge of Roy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.72,0:19:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我昨晚跟他一起去找了个小小的乐子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I joined him last night for what he calls a wee Goldie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.21,0:19:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}班尼特来了 还是那么风风火火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's Bennett, precipitous as ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.93,0:19:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.52,0:19:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.96,0:20:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 华生医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Holmes, Dr. Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.92,0:20:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我必须为昨天的会面道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must apologize for your unfortunate encounter yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.33,0:20:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 但同时… - 没必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But also… - There's no need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.55,0:20:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实上 恰好给这件怪事\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, it has provided the very first clue{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.67,0:20:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}提供了第一个线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}to this odd affair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.74,0:20:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.18,0:20:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.75,0:20:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 我不能装作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Holmes, I cannot pretend that I am happy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.31,0:20:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接到你的邀请时很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}to have answered your summons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.93,0:20:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 我仍然欣赏你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course and I continue to appreciate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.35,0:20:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那分裂的忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}the division of your loyalties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.78,0:20:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以你有些事情没有坦诚以告也不足为奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no small wonder that you've withheld so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.17,0:20:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伊第一次袭击它的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy first attacked his master on the evening{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.39,0:20:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是在九月二日的晚上 是么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}of September the 2nd, did he not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.44,0:20:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是怎么知道的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.75,0:20:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在教授从书房去到门厅的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}As the professor came from his study into the hall{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.88,0:20:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这种情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}he restrained the dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.63,0:20:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他拴住狗 把它关在储藏室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}On this occasion he was merely shut up in the scullery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.41,0:20:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第二天早晨又一切正常了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next morning he was as right as rain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.31,0:20:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这都是麦克费尔告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}or so Macphail informs me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.71,0:20:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}麦克费尔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Macphail?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.93,0:20:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有谁能比家里的马车夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who better than the family coachman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.01,0:20:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更能告诉我实情呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to advise me how matters might truly stand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.40,0:20:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请原谅 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.39,0:20:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我应该亲自告诉你这些 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have told you myself but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.90,0:20:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.61,0:21:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第二次袭击是在13天后\N{\fnArial\fs30}The second attack occurred 13 days later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.56,0:21:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同样 教授是在门厅里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again, the professor was in the hall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.51,0:21:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}幸运的是 这一次他关上了书房的门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortunately this time he was able to put the study door between himself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.47,0:21:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}挡住了狗 是不是这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the altered animal, was he not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.52,0:21:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是从那会起 伊迪丝希望把罗伊锁起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edith wanted Roy chained from that moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.08,0:21:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但她父亲不同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}But her father overruled her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.04,0:21:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他坚持说它还是条可爱温柔的狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He insisted that he was still a dear affectionate dog, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.29,0:21:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本性上不会伤人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he wasn't congenitally vicious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.07,0:21:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那在第三次袭击后呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not after the third attack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.95,0:21:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 他再没有这么说 而是把狗栓了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he did agree then that he had to be restrained.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.79,0:21:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后罗伊就被这么被锁在马房里了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Roy was banished to the chain in the stable yard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.18,0:21:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.45,0:21:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}麦克费尔认为罗伊行为的变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Macphail believes that the change in Roy's behavior{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.76,0:21:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大约是两个月前出现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}stems from about two months ago?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.47,0:21:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想或许是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it may have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.56,0:21:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没有特别注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, I didn't keep a straight note of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.27,0:21:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去问问你的未婚妻 还有麦克费尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consult your fiance Bennett and Macphail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.49,0:21:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于这件事 有必要做一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}A precise log of these events{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.13,0:21:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确切的记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}may yet prove pertinent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.69,0:21:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我注意到教授今天下午\N{\fnArial\fs30}I observed that the professor lectures{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.69,0:21:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两点钟在大学里有个讲座\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the university at 2:00 this afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.35,0:21:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到时我会到家里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall call then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.96,0:21:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我不同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I couldn't possibly agree, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.43,0:21:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}班尼特 普利斯伯瑞小姐不是在做梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bennett, Ms. Presbury did not dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.88,0:21:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是有什么人或什么东西探访了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone or something looked in upon her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.92,0:22:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信你的未婚妻处境极为危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my conviction that your fiance is in grave danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.44,0:22:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来自谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}From who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.77,0:22:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 先生 应该说是来自什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir, from whom or from what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.09,0:22:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为秘书 你负责处理教授的通信\N{\fnArial\fs30}As secretary you handle the professor's correspondence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.42,0:22:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我的职责是是拆阅每一封信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yes, it's my responsibility to open every letter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.11,0:22:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}普利斯伯瑞小姐一直习惯于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has it always been Ms. Presbury's habit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.03,0:22:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每天晚上锁上卧室的门么\N{\fnArial\fs30}to lock her bedroom door at night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.35,0:22:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呃 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, no, well it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.24,0:22:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她告诉我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}well she told me that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.08,0:22:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.68,0:22:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是在罗伊举止怪异之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was after Roy began to behave so strangely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.87,0:22:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她也开始害怕狗了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}That she too became afraid of the dog?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.61,0:22:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 你不能碰他的书桌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Holmes, you mustn't touch his desk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.35,0:22:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}班尼特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bennett!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.45,0:22:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.81,0:23:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我教授和这个叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inform me of the correspondence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.58,0:23:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多拉克的通信情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}the professor had with someone called Dorak{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.02,0:23:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}住在科姆里德\N{\fnArial\fs30}inhabiting Com Read.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.44,0:23:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.29,0:23:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}商业街 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commercial Road of course CC.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.99,0:23:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}似乎教授本人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would appear that the professor answers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.01,0:23:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲自回复此人的信件\N{\fnArial\fs30}such correspondence himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.03,0:23:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 又是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, again…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.77,0:23:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又是吞吞吐吐的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again, you've been reluctant to speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.97,0:23:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.27,0:23:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大约8周前 他告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some eight weeks ago he told me that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.39,0:23:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有一些邮件从东区寄来\N{\fnArial\fs30}certain missives might arrive from East Central{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.10,0:23:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邮票上划着十字\N{\fnArial\fs30}marked by a cross under the stamp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.77,0:23:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个密码？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A code?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.91,0:23:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些信是定期寄来的么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And did they regularly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.41,0:23:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是定期的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Irregularly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.97,0:23:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不得拆阅 也不能跟别人说起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was to leave them unopened and speak of them to no one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.41,0:23:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说邮件\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said missive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.80,0:23:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不光是信么\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were not letters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.19,0:23:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有些是 还有些是小包裹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, some were, others were small packets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.80,0:23:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你注意到 普利斯伯瑞教授如何回复么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And did you observe Professor Presbury's replies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.44,0:24:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.12,0:24:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些都不由我经手\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't pass through my hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.48,0:24:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但有证据表明他确实回信了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet the evidence would suggest that he did respond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.91,0:24:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}印度人认为 狗是猴子的天敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the Hindu the dog is a traditional enemy of the monkey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.59,0:24:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这说明什么 华生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.41,0:24:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.57,0:24:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.45,0:24:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.26,0:24:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I, I wasn't aware.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.48,0:24:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没来得及告诉你 你已经出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I couldn't tell you, you'd already gone out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.11,0:24:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.17,0:24:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我邀请爱丽丝来和我们喝茶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've invited Alice to take tea with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.02,0:24:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别对你的未婚夫太严厉了 普利斯伯瑞小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not be too severe upon your fiance Ms. Presbury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.80,0:24:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他已经尽了全力\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has acted for the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.32,0:24:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另外 也请您继续每晚锁好门\N{\fnArial\fs30}And please will you continue to lock your door at night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.32,0:24:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}窥视您的可不是普通的生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The prowler who looked in upon you is no ordinary creature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.33,0:24:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.37,0:24:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰克 你不该带他到这来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, you shouldn't have brought him in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.30,0:24:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没有 但他坚持要来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to but he insisted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.59,0:24:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说这里有极大的危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says there's grave danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.61,0:24:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是歇洛克·福尔摩斯么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that Sherlock Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.39,0:24:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大侦探福尔摩斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Sherlock Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.08,0:25:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你已经观察到了这件事情的核心 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your observation goes to the very heart of this business Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.35,0:25:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}观察？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Observation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.12,0:25:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}猴子和狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Considering the monkey and the dog, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.22,0:25:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这就是事情的核心 - 哦 你这么想？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- the very heart of it. - Oh, you think so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.31,0:25:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 如果你好心的陪我去大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now if you'd be so kind as to accompany me to the university{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.97,0:25:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还可以继续去商业街\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can drive on to the Commercial Road, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.13,0:25:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜访一下多拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}inquire after Dorak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.13,0:25:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}商业街可不是个具体地址 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not an address Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.89,0:25:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这街有一里多长呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Commercial Road is a mile long{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.81,0:25:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从东边的艾尔盖特一直到莱姆豪斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}from Allgate east to LimeHouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.67,0:25:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}问问小商贩 多拉克的铺子在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll ask a custom monger where Dorak's shop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.77,0:25:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}铺子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shop?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.77,0:25:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走吧 华生 我要迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on Watson, I'm going to be late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.85,0:25:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在非洲 亚洲和南美洲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The equatorial rain forests of Africa, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.39,0:25:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}热带雨林中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asia and Southern America{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.85,0:25:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}充满了常见物种的各种声音和活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}are filled with the sound and movement of a multitude of species{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.84,0:25:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以灵长目动物家族为例\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the primate family, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.54,0:25:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种身体活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}This physical activity, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.23,0:25:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}像在树枝上晃荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}the swinging amongst branches, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.90,0:25:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或从一棵树的树顶 跳到另一棵树的树顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}the flying leaps from treetop to treetop{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.26,0:25:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及发出刺耳的喊叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}and loud raucous calling, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.00,0:25:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不仅仅是为了捍卫在森林里的势力范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}not only defines territorial rights in the forest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.17,0:25:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比如食物的采集\N{\fnArial\fs30}For example for food gathering, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.22,0:26:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其中大树和灌木的嫩芽\N{\fnArial\fs30}the tender shoots of tree and shrub{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.97,0:26:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是特别的奖励\N{\fnArial\fs30}are particularly prized, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.88,0:26:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时也常常是\N{\fnArial\fs30}but also is frequently among{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.60,0:26:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雄性展示力量的一种仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}the males a ritual display{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.26,0:26:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者是为了防止不受欢迎的入侵者\N{\fnArial\fs30}either to ward off unwelcome intruders{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.53,0:26:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者是向某一只雌性\N{\fnArial\fs30}or to impress a particular female{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.79,0:26:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}展现它的性潜能\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a sexual potential of the performer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.00,0:26:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢诸位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.58,0:27:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下午好 你在找人么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good afternoon, looking for somebody are ya?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.30,0:27:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想这附近好像有个马车行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe there's some livery stables here or nearby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.44,0:27:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 隔壁倒是有个妓院\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, we got a Macker's Yard next door, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.33,0:27:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.04,0:27:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 没错 你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, right, right you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.32,0:27:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此路不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a dead end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.70,0:27:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看倒是可以过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I could see a way through, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.79,0:27:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是条子还是怎么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a narc or what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.35,0:27:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.56,0:27:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.55,0:27:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.19,0:28:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说了 走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.40,0:28:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是不肯听我的 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just can't take it in, can you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.65,0:28:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg your pardon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.75,0:28:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说了走开 你就给我乖乖的走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said out and I meant out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.72,0:28:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里闲人免进 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}No admittance, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.83,0:28:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可是商业场所\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are commercial premises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.08,0:28:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这么说是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean by that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.47,0:28:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是说这是家商店\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it's a shop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.35,0:28:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那今天肯定是很早就打烊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be early closing day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.96,0:28:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可真够荒唐的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is ridiculous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.20,0:28:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.27,0:28:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的雷斯垂德 你这样的大人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear Lestrade, I'm astonished that you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.17,0:28:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}竟来调查这么件小事\N{\fnArial\fs30}a man of your standing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.44,0:28:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真让我惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}should call upon so petty an errand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.66,0:28:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}普利斯伯瑞教授对你的调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor Presbury objects most strenuously{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.64,0:28:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}表示了最强烈的抗议 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}to your investigations Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.15,0:28:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他抱怨说那是缺乏正当理由的骚扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}His complaint is that of unjustified harassment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.67,0:28:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是否有正当理由还有待证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}The justification has yet to be proved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.95,0:28:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}普利斯伯瑞是否把事实都告诉你了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has Presbury informed you of the facts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.03,0:28:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.80,0:29:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你的结论是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your conclusions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.75,0:29:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这女孩在半梦半醒之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}A girl half asleep, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.34,0:29:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将一只猫或是鸟误认为是闯入者\N{\fnArial\fs30}mistook a cat or a bird or both for an intruder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.66,0:29:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.72,0:29:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小事一桩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's trifle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.81,0:29:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就这么简单的解释？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a simple explanation, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.46,0:29:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 这说明不了家里的那条狗的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}however, it begs the question of the family dog, does it not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.97,0:29:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.22,0:29:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What dog?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.21,0:29:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}普利斯伯瑞没有提及在这件事中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Presbury did not mention{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.58,0:29:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伊的举止怪异么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy's part in this affair is strange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.14,0:29:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好歹罗伊也算半个目击者呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly a partial witness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.29,0:29:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我建议你问问他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest you ask him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.16,0:29:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没有掌握这个复杂的案件的全部事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not in full possession of the facts of this complex case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.91,0:29:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就算我相信你说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust you to say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.92,0:29:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这事比看上去复杂 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's more to it than meets the eye, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.04,0:29:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有这种刺激的话 我就不从事这个行当了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never concern myself in anything without that stimulus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.52,0:29:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但要是你一意孤行\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you persist you may find yourself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.10,0:29:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到头来可能会被提起个人诉讼的 你知道么\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the wrong end of a private prosecution you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.36,0:29:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教授是个很坚决的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor Presbury is a determined man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.11,0:29:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那和我倒是颇为相似哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we're fairly matched, are we not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.48,0:29:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我早知道你会是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.57,0:29:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 我要说的都说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I've said my say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.74,0:29:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.05,0:29:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lestrade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.33,0:30:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 你能行么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, you can do it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.98,0:30:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 比在梅德斯通干的那一票容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, easier than Maidstone, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.81,0:30:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可怜的老家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}poor old fellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.89,0:31:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}商业街144号\N{\fnArial\fs30}144 Commercial Road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.67,0:31:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 你找到多拉克了 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you located Dorak, good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.10,0:31:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就我目前所知道的 表面上看来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He appears to run a general store as far as I can tell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.82,0:31:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他经营着一家杂货店 从熨斗到鱼钩什么都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sells everything from flatirons to fishhooks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.85,0:31:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能说的详细点么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you be more specific?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.14,0:31:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这家店生意不怎么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, can't be a very prosperous business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.42,0:31:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.40,0:31:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为普通人是不让进的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the general public are not allowed in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.62,0:31:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还发现什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you discover anything else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.49,0:31:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了在店旁的巷子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apart from being threatened{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.43,0:31:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被个野蛮的家伙威胁之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}by an unhelpful brute{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.73,0:31:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就没有什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}in an alley at the side, very little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.83,0:31:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}显然他就在那工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}He obviously works there because he followed me back{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.78,0:31:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为他又跟着我回到了杂货店 还威胁我\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the shop and threatened me again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.69,0:31:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 还有另一个衣着光鲜的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there was another fellow sharply dressed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.41,0:31:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}穿着马甲 留着小胡子\N{\fnArial\fs30}a waistcoat with a mustache.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.48,0:31:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叼着雪茄？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Cheroot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.52,0:31:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 叼着雪茄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes, he did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.44,0:31:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听起来像是哈利威尔考克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like Harry Wilcox, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.21,0:31:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}通常在Soho广场附近活动 而不是东区\N{\fnArial\fs30}more usually of Soho Square than the East End.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.23,0:31:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything further?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.11,0:31:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么了 除了那气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really except the smell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.36,0:31:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那地方有种古怪的气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a very odd smell about the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.77,0:32:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是什么的气味？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.88,0:32:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不好说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well it's not easy to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.06,0:32:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有点像是什么动物的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It belonged to the animal kingdom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.27,0:32:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}稻草或是马厩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straw or stables?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.52,0:32:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更像是动物园\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like a zoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.27,0:32:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还没睡啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.18,0:32:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 先生 我想整理完这些论据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir, I thought I might finish these proofs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.46,0:32:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真是太尽责了 但你该去睡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very conscientious of you but no, no, you get to bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.42,0:32:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还是稍等会吧 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather not, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.09,0:32:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我想等… - 去睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I should like… - Get to bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.84,0:32:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.27,0:32:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 先生 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir, very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.58,0:32:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.32,0:32:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.07,0:33:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的 快醒醒 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darling wake up, it's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.43,0:33:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊迪丝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edith?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.67,0:33:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.27,0:33:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我 快开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me, open the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.33,0:33:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.28,0:33:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.01,0:34:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没法形容\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't describe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.49,0:34:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个闯入者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the intruder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.86,0:34:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得叫醒你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must rouse your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.83,0:34:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}普利斯伯瑞教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor Presbury?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.06,0:34:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.09,0:34:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.40,0:34:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们俩个怎么啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of you, what is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.54,0:34:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰克觉得他看见了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack thought he saw…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.51,0:34:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fancied I, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.22,0:34:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听到有人闯入 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard an intruder, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.77,0:34:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.42,0:34:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 罗伊也是躁动不安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Roy too was exercised{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.16,0:34:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我朝外看时 却什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}but when I looked out just now there was nothing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.46,0:34:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伊也安静了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he since quieted down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.17,0:34:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你说你看到了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you thought you saw…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.39,0:34:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我想我看到了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I thought I saw…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.08,0:34:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.78,0:34:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一只动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}An animal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.34,0:34:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一只动物？\N{\fnArial\fs30}An animal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.52,0:34:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 可能是因为光线的原因看错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it must have been a trick of the light, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.51,0:34:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定是这样 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have been, yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.73,0:35:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我弄错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was mistaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.74,0:35:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}My apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.20,0:35:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.67,0:35:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}班尼特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bennett?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.42,0:35:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.37,0:35:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好好睡会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.24,0:35:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会有用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a good chap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.15,0:35:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.72,0:36:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}（猴子失窃案）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.98,0:36:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原来如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.94,0:36:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.62,0:36:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.91,0:36:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.48,0:36:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是同一伙人干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unofficially a gang is at work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.66,0:36:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其他动物园报告类似的失窃了么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other zoological gardens have reported similar thefts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.34,0:36:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我在德里斯科尔的同事在调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, my colleagues in Driscoll are investigating the theft{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.63,0:36:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上周两只恒河猴和一只狒狒\N{\fnArial\fs30}of two rhesus monkeys and a baboon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.59,0:37:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}失窃的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}removed only last week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.69,0:37:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}牛津郡一个马戏团\N{\fnArial\fs30}A traveling menagerie in Oxfordshire{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.31,0:37:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}丢了一只珍贵的黑猩猩\N{\fnArial\fs30}lost a prized chimpanzee{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.91,0:37:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有梅德斯通也丢了他们最好的大猩猩\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Maidstone, their finest gorilla.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.95,0:37:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 「大查理」？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Big Charlie"? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.61,0:37:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个讨人喜欢的家伙 我很熟悉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delightful chap. I knew him well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.00,0:37:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们都消失的无影无踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they've all disappeared without a trace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.56,0:37:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生感兴趣的是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Mr. Holmes, what's his interest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.32,0:37:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他认为这可能与他手里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He insisted to me that this may have relevance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.16,0:37:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另外一个案子有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}to another case he has in hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.08,0:37:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是可能的话 一般我们都会迁就他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We like to indulge him when we can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.35,0:37:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找到你想要的了么 福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find anything to the purpose, Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.55,0:37:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.42,0:37:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉过你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I warned you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.82,0:37:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的人已经把这里仔细梳理过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}my men have been through it with a tooth comb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.02,0:37:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开锁的是斯德普格林的詹金斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lock was released by Jenkins of Stepping Green.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.57,0:37:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}猩猩是被一小包氯仿给麻醉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The primate was quieted with a pad of chloroform{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.06,0:37:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个人头发还上了发蜡\N{\fnArial\fs30}administered by someone who lavishes their hair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.70,0:37:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是从詹宁街的布鲁斯特先生那买来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}with Mr. Brewster of Jernin Street's Pomade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.75,0:37:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这还表明这个人的胡子也上了蜡\N{\fnArial\fs30}This would suggest that he also sports a waxed mustache, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.66,0:37:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布鲁斯特先生以经营男士发蜡而出名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Brewster being celebrated for his cosmetic wax for gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.19,0:37:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么看来 雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this was so Lestrade you could do worse{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.21,0:38:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去跟Soho广场的哈瑞谈谈 是没有坏处的\N{\fnArial\fs30}than have a word with Harry the Tash Wilcox of Soho.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.58,0:38:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good lord Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.79,0:38:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对你来说是「没什么」\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're nothing much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.84,0:38:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对别人来说可是了不得的资料了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would be anyone else a great deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.40,0:38:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 不过我相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well I'm sure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.56,0:38:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是我们的人把报告交上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}my men will arrive at the same conclusion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.49,0:38:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里头也会有相同的结论的\N{\fnArial\fs30}once their reports are in hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.13,0:38:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你自然也注意到了 雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will also naturally have noticed Lestrade{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.34,0:38:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是这几周来\N{\fnArial\fs30}that this is the sixth reported theft{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.03,0:38:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第六宗成年雄性灵长类动物失窃案了\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a mature male primate in as many weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.58,0:38:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是嘛 有六起啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it six?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.68,0:38:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怪事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exceptional.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.45,0:38:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想重要的是这些失窃动物的性别\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gender of the animals removed is I suggest of the essence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.74,0:38:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.80,0:38:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.84,0:38:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我最亲爱的爱丽丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dearest Alice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.49,0:38:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没有打扰你的工作吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not interrupting your work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.62,0:38:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.25,0:38:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也没有忙什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't seriously engaged, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.65,0:39:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是整理些笔记以备查考 没什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}just some notes of future inquiry, nothing more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.75,0:39:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们去客厅好么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we go to the drawing room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.81,0:39:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}年轻女士在这儿恐怕不会感到愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is hardly the place to entertain a young lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.59,0:39:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不必了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.11,0:39:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.01,0:39:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我亲爱的 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear child, what is the matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.66,0:39:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以前就该告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ought to have said before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.61,0:39:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ought to what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.54,0:39:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得把这个收回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, you must take it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.31,0:39:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是 爱丽丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Alice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.74,0:39:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能嫁给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't marry you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.84,0:39:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以前不该答应的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't have said I would, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.31,0:39:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我不敢说不\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I was afraid to say no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.54,0:39:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请你拿回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please take it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.10,0:39:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 胡说 这只不过是… - 不 你得拿回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nonsense, This is simply… - No, you must take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.54,0:39:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.07,0:39:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱丽丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.08,0:39:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 你很老\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're old, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.13,0:39:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太老了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're too old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.81,0:40:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么说 班尼特确实在房子里看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Bennett actually saw the intruders shadow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.59,0:40:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}闯入者的影子\N{\fnArial\fs30}inside the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.27,0:40:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但却查不出任何的蛛丝马迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}But upon investigation could find no further trace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.84,0:40:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得让屠夫家的男孩把这个交给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must get this to him by way of the butcher's boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.90,0:40:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要来么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.98,0:40:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.82,0:40:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去多拉克的杂货铺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dorak's Emporium, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.95,0:40:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特别是詹金斯守着 不让你进去的那些地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially those parts where Jenkins took such pains to guard against you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.12,0:40:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 有兴趣么？- 很乐意去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you game? - Delighted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.82,0:40:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你带着武器去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go armed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.92,0:40:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我去艾尔盖特东区从来都带着枪的 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always carry a firearm east of Allgate, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.90,0:41:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我担心的就是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's as I feared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.70,0:41:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们就等着你来访呢 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We was waiting on a visit, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.83,0:42:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威尔考克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wilcox!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.08,0:42:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有詹金斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Jenkins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.69,0:42:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老天作证 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}By heavens Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.01,0:42:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我闻到的就是这个味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is what I smelt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.80,0:42:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是多拉克的病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are Dorak's patients, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.15,0:42:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被虐待的可怜家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}poor abused creatures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.24,0:42:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看过多拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you observed the experiments{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.58,0:42:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在它们身上做手术么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Dorak performs on them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.97,0:42:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 他说这不关我们什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no that's none of our business he says.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.13,0:42:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就算你自己走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well count yourself fortunate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.21,0:42:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会起诉到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the process has been kept from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.95,0:42:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 先生们 进去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now gentlemen in you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.62,0:42:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到里面去 跟它在一起？为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}In there with him? Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.27,0:42:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等着警察来\N{\fnArial\fs30}To await the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.85,0:42:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进去 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}In gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.61,0:43:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会让雷斯垂德探长马上过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should advise Inspector Lestrade at once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.36,0:43:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不能把我们关在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't leave us in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.45,0:43:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别忘了大猩猩也是爱交际的动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember the gorilla is a social animal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.13,0:43:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你俩都注意举止\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if you both mind your manners{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.89,0:43:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我敢说你们会相处的很融洽的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will do well enough I dare say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.99,0:43:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}班尼特先生 还有普利斯伯瑞小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bennett and Ms. Presbury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.89,0:43:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.93,0:43:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我决定要陪着杰克 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I decided I had to accompany Jack, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.74,0:43:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm delighted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.39,0:43:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有没有把举止失常的日期列出来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you brought the list of missing dates?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.99,0:43:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 还有罗伊在这些日子里也都叫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Roy also barked on these nights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.79,0:43:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先别管那个了 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please never mind that Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.65,0:43:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们还有更紧急的事要告诉您\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have far more urgent matters to impart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.71,0:43:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.88,0:43:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}墨菲小姐解除了和我父亲的婚约\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Morphy has renounced my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.94,0:43:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她把戒指也退回来了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's returned his ring?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.52,0:43:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 就在今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.58,0:43:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后教授就把自己反锁在书房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when he has remained locked in his study.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.56,0:43:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每次我去敲门他都粗暴地向我喊叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time I've knocked he's shouted abuse at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.58,0:43:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们担心…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We, we fear…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.35,0:43:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些数字之间有什么联系 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The logic of it Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.60,0:43:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看出来了么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}of this progression, do you see it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.93,0:44:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.77,0:44:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最开始的三次是显而易见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first three occasions are self-evident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.63,0:44:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know of those.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.95,0:44:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在10月5日发生了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened on the 5th of October?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.85,0:44:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伊整个晚上都在叫 12日也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy barked all night, on the 12th too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.05,0:44:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这也是教授收到从伦敦东区\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're also days upon which the professor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.19,0:44:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}寄来的包裹的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}received packages from London East Central.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.21,0:44:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这天是在窗口出现了人影的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the date on which the face appeared{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.43,0:44:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在四天前？\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the window four nights ago?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.75,0:44:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.91,0:44:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是昨晚你看到黑影的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is where the shadow appeared last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.38,0:44:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.22,0:44:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}共同的因素有两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The common factor is two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.39,0:44:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总是有两天的间隔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always the gap decreases by two days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.37,0:44:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真是个傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Numskull, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.90,0:44:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而今天是10月21日\N{\fnArial\fs30}And today is the 21st of October.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.98,0:44:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.15,0:44:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 有个包裹 今天早上到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, a package arrived this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.45,0:44:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}决定性的时刻到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the crisis is upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.85,0:44:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昨晚不过是个序幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night was but the precursor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.32,0:44:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快 我们得马上出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, we must go at once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.29,0:45:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快 快点 路上再给你们解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come along, come along, I'll explain on the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.70,0:45:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}前门是开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The front door is open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.93,0:45:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}班尼特 到楼上检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bennett, examine upstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.60,0:45:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.39,0:45:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}果然如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought as much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.87,0:45:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你听见了么 福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.89,0:45:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听到了 普瑞斯伯利小姐 听的很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too well, Ms. Presbury, too well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.36,0:45:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看那上面 快看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up there, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.73,0:46:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老天啊 福尔摩斯 你说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My heavens Holmes, you were right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.46,0:46:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他朝墨菲小姐家走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's headed across to Ms. Morphy's house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.63,0:46:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}班尼特 留在这保护小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bennett stay here and protect Ms. Presbury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.14,0:47:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的目标是阳台\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's aiming for that balcony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.36,0:47:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}门是锁上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's locked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.47,0:47:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}狗 华生 留心狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dog Watson, the dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.34,0:47:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.01,0:47:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请你走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}please keep away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.58,0:48:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是侥幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a close thing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.22,0:48:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}差一点就咬到颈动脉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}just missed the carotid artery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.48,0:48:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他还好么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.84,0:48:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}性命没有大碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.96,0:48:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信这件事之后 他会改过自新\N{\fnArial\fs30}A reformed man I have no doubt after his experience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.42,0:48:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的雷斯垂德 我希望把这事归功于你\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear Lestrade I quite intended you to have the credit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.82,0:48:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但要指证多拉克 威尔考克斯和詹金斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}but to complete the case against Dorak, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.72,0:48:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}了结这案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wilcox and Jenkins{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.77,0:48:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还需要这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll need this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.66,0:48:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是确实的证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here is the incontrovertible proof{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.81,0:48:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们偷那些动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}that those animals you've rescued from degradation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.43,0:48:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为的就是获取血清\N{\fnArial\fs30}were stolen for the sake of their glands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.87,0:48:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些动物被高价买卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}The animal extract was sold at an enormous profit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.23,0:48:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是因为有些十分愚蠢或绝望的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to those foolish or desperate enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.95,0:48:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}幻想用它们的血清\N{\fnArial\fs30}to imagine that a course of serum{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.55,0:48:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来恢复青春\N{\fnArial\fs30}could restore their lost vitality{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.49,0:48:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而没有其他副作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}without any other effects.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.09,0:48:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我十分感激你 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am grateful to you Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.32,0:48:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为有你 我们才查到了犯罪的源头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks to you we've traced the evil to its source.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.34,0:48:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许吧 可是可怜的普利斯伯瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps, but poor Presbury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.24,0:49:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个人想要凌驾于自然\N{\fnArial\fs30}When one tries to rise above nature, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.53,0:49:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他就会堕落到丧失本性\N{\fnArial\fs30}one is liable to fall below it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.46,0:49:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最高等的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The highest type of man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.54,0:49:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一旦偏离了人类注定的轨迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}may revert to the animal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.38,0:49:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就会变成动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he leaves the straight road of destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.07,0:49:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哲学上的事情还是留给你自己去想吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well I'll leave the philosophy to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.51,0:49:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.69,0:49:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是明智之举 雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite the best Lestrade, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.93,0:49:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一向都是这么干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.10,0:49:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那条爱尔兰猎狗要人道毁灭么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the wolfhound to be destroyed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.84,0:49:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 罗伊攻击的是猴子 而不是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no it was the monkey that Roy attacked, not the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.89,0:49:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}狗会和他的主人一样都恢复原样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the dog will be himself again quite as much as his master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.43,0:49:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢二位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thank you both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.78,0:49:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good day, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.03,0:49:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见 雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good day Lestrade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.53,0:49:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我可以这么说的话 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I my say so Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.03,0:49:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得你给予雷斯垂德过多的功劳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you went a little too far in allowing Lestrade all the credit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.41,0:49:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不全是这样 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.47,0:49:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可以把它存在我们的办案记录里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can file it away in our archives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.14,0:49:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总有为人所知的那一天的\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day the entire truth can be told.{\r}
